# Predator Ooze: "Whenever a creature dealt damage by this creature this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature" (CR 603.2,
# 120.3). Attacking on turn 3 it gets its counter and is a 2/2; Bot2's Grizzly Bears block it, take 2 damage and die, so it gets a
# second counter (3/3). The Bears' 2 damage is lethal to a 2/2 but not to an indestructible creature (CR 702.12b), which survives.

